# Adaptive UI (Mobile + Desktop)

Platforms ship together: phone portrait and desktop/window landscape. Every HUD change must work in both.

## Required patterns

- Canvas: `ScaleWithScreenSize`, reference **1080×1920** (portrait-first), `matchWidthOrHeight ≈ 0.5`, `pixelPerfect = true`.
- Always inset content with `Screen.safeArea` via `AdaptiveShell` (notches / home indicator).
- Prefer **LayoutGroups + LayoutElement** over absolute pixel anchors for action rows and lists.
- Best-fit **off** for Title/Body/Button/Caption (legacy Text blurs with best-fit + fractional scale).
- Use `TextRole` (`Title` / `Body` / `Button` / `Caption`) — not raw font sizes.
- Long character labels: multiline via `UiFactory.ToMultilineActionLabel`.
- Gesture thresholds (swipe) must be **relative to screen width**, not fixed pixels.
- **Arrow hints**: every interactive action button must show its key (`↑` `←` `→` `↓`) via `FinalizeActions`.
- Binding: 1=`↑`; 2=`←``→`; 3=`↑``←``→`; 4=+`↓`. Level forces `←` left / `→` right always; `↑` skill **only when a usable DBT charge exists**. Therapy (5+): `↑↓` focus, `→`/Enter confirm, `←` Back.
- Touch/click still works alongside keyboard. No gameplay rules inside widgets.

## Compact type scale (Reigns-like density)

Reference portrait **1080×1920**. Keep chrome compact so content + actions fit without clipping.

| Role | Size |
|------|------|
| Title | 28 |
| Body | 22 |
| Button | 18–20 |
| Caption | 18 |

Buttons: `minHeight` **72**, preferred **80**. Tap target ≥ 64. Action cells: ~72 single-line, ~88 two-line.

## Shell band flex / mins

| Band | flex | min |
|------|------|-----|
| Header | 0.06 | 40 |
| Stats | 0.15 | 96 |
| Content | 0.34 | 120 |
| Actions | 0.45 | 200 |

- Stats: **2×2 grid**, cell height floor **56**. Do not pack four tiny columns on mobile.
- Actions: **1 column in portrait**; landscape max **2 columns** and only when host width ≥ 1100. Never 3 columns for long labels.
- Hint/status live in the **content** band (above actions), never under the action grid.
- Character select / Meta: keep content compact (card hidden) so ActionsBand can show all buttons.
- Meta: **symptom tree** (all 9) in content **ScrollRect** (masked) — not ActionsBand; actions = Reduce / Therapy / Next level. Meta/Therapy shell: content flex ↑, actions flex ↓.
- Therapy: **merge board** (S/T/B + locked Emotion/Need) in same scroll host; actions = Merge / Back (+ short phase switches). Compact board cards ~52–56.

## Verification

- Game view **Scale = 1x** only. Scale 2x/3x is editor zoom and will look huge/soft even when the UI is correct.
- Smoke both: **1080×1920** and **1920×1080** at Scale 1x.
- Character select: title/stats/body readable but not dominating; all three character buttons fully visible with arrow prefixes; no hint/status stacked under buttons.
- Meta / level buttons stay sharp and respond to arrow keys.
